    Node = property(__Node.value, __Node.set, None, 'gml:Node represents the 0-dimensional primitive.\nThe optional coboundary of a node (gml:directedEdge) is a sequence of directed edges which are incident on this node. Edges emanating from this node appear in the node coboundary with a negative orientation. \nIf provided, the aggregationType attribute shall have the value "sequence".\nA node may optionally be realised by a 0-dimensional geometric primitive (gml:pointProperty).')

    
